WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.650
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.920 --> 01:43.979
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.229 --> 01:46.820
[Episode 24]

4
01:47.229 --> 01:48.000
Right foot.

5
01:52.200 --> 01:53.000
Xue,

6
01:53.000 --> 01:54.060
you go on upstairs.

7
01:55.120 --> 01:56.920
I'm going out to buy a few things.

8
01:56.920 --> 01:57.590
All right,

9
01:59.789 --> 02:00.430
I'm off.

10
02:00.590 --> 02:01.070
Okay.

11
02:01.400 --> 02:02.430
Be careful, okay?

12
02:02.350 --> 02:07.900
[No Passengers Allowed]

13
02:03.400 --> 02:04.730
You'd better head back.

14
02:04.790 --> 02:05.590
Want me to walk you up?

15
02:05.590 --> 02:06.870
No need, go on back.

16
02:06.920 --> 02:07.430
Bye.

17
02:10.400 --> 02:12.000
I'll be off, too, Uncle Gong.

18
02:39.520 --> 02:40.980
What's wrong, Uncle Gong?

19
02:48.470 --> 02:50.000
You two should get married.

20
02:55.710 --> 02:56.520
Get married?

21
02:57.280 --> 02:58.910
What, you don't want to?

22
02:59.240 --> 03:00.120
Forget I said anything.

23
03:00.120 --> 03:00.840
I do! I do!

24
03:00.840 --> 03:02.000
I really do!

25
03:02.030 --> 03:03.470
More than anything!

26
03:06.000 --> 03:08.240
I just... don't you think it's a little soon?

27
03:08.240 --> 03:09.150
She really

28
03:10.280 --> 03:11.590
likes you,

29
03:12.590 --> 03:13.400
and you

30
03:15.310 --> 03:16.910
clearly care about her, too.

31
03:17.120 --> 03:18.520
I can see that.

32
03:20.800 --> 03:22.280
I've been observing you

33
03:22.960 --> 03:25.120
for quite some time now.

34
03:25.470 --> 03:26.930
You're honest and decent.

35
03:26.960 --> 03:28.190
A good young man.

36
03:36.750 --> 03:38.400
My family's

37
03:39.960 --> 03:40.800
not well-off.

38
03:41.190 --> 03:43.120
I'm just worried that...

39
03:50.190 --> 03:51.960
These days,

40
03:52.240 --> 03:54.370
as long as you're willing to work hard,

41
03:54.710 --> 03:56.970
you'll always find a way to make a living.

42
03:57.430 --> 03:59.190
As for material things and all that,

43
03:59.190 --> 04:00.910
I don't need any of it.

44
04:01.630 --> 04:03.150
No bride price, no engagement gifts,

45
04:03.150 --> 04:05.080
none of that nonsense.

46
04:06.680 --> 04:08.140
I have just one condition:

47
04:16.310 --> 04:17.769
you have to treat her well.

48
04:21.480 --> 04:22.800
You have to treat her

49
04:23.630 --> 04:24.830
even better than I do.

50
04:28.390 --> 04:29.190
Uncle Gong,

51
04:30.510 --> 04:31.570
I promise you this:

52
04:32.390 --> 04:34.390
as long as I, Jia Xin, am breathing,

53
04:34.750 --> 04:35.950
I'll never let Xue suffer

54
04:35.950 --> 04:37.350
a single bit of hardship.

55
04:38.120 --> 04:39.720
I may not have much right now,

56
04:39.800 --> 04:41.190
but I'll work hard.

57
04:41.270 --> 04:43.400
Things will only get better from here.

58
04:44.000 --> 04:45.270
If I ever break this promise,

59
04:45.270 --> 04:47.400
may I meet the same fate as this bottle!

60
04:54.310 --> 04:55.830
You two really need

61
04:57.360 --> 04:59.290
to read fewer martial arts novels.

62
04:59.700 --> 05:05.180
[Fucheng Xiaoximen Hospital]

63
05:00.830 --> 05:01.600
President,

64
05:02.560 --> 05:03.310
why'd you bring me here

65
05:03.310 --> 05:04.830
in the middle of the night?

66
05:05.240 --> 05:06.560
The hospital's been sealed off.

67
05:06.560 --> 05:08.220
We're trespassing, you know.

68
05:14.000 --> 05:15.000
I brought you here

69
05:15.160 --> 05:16.720
to talk business.

70
05:17.750 --> 05:18.920
You need to be here

71
05:18.950 --> 05:20.480
to really get the feel of it.

72
05:21.190 --> 05:22.120
What do you mean?

73
05:22.560 --> 05:24.090
Is the hospital reopening?

74
05:24.830 --> 05:26.030
Something like that.

75
05:28.120 --> 05:29.240
That's wonderful!

76
05:30.920 --> 05:32.780
I can finally go back to my office.

77
05:33.630 --> 05:34.510
You have no idea

78
05:34.510 --> 05:35.310
how miserable I've been at home

79
05:35.310 --> 05:37.120
all these days.

80
05:37.630 --> 05:38.720
Whenever I'm at the hospital,

81
05:38.720 --> 05:39.390
I...

82
05:39.630 --> 05:40.510
I sleep like a baby

83
05:40.510 --> 05:41.510
as long as I'm at the hospital.

84
05:41.510 --> 05:44.110
I just keep nodding off, one nap after another.

85
05:44.159 --> 05:45.390
You can forget

86
05:45.510 --> 05:47.240
about going back to those days.

87
05:47.430 --> 05:48.240
What?

88
05:50.360 --> 05:52.830
The hospital's reopening,

89
05:52.830 --> 05:53.510
but

90
05:54.070 --> 05:55.310
I'm getting fired?

91
05:57.830 --> 05:59.230
What... what do you mean?

92
06:02.600 --> 06:03.720
I didn't do it on purpose!

93
06:03.720 --> 06:05.190
I got so excited that I sat down without even realizing it.

94
06:05.190 --> 06:05.750
Please,

95
06:05.750 --> 06:06.610
take your seat.

96
06:06.630 --> 06:07.190
Please, take your seat.

97
06:07.190 --> 06:08.190
I-I'll always follow your lead.

98
06:08.190 --> 06:08.750
Please.

99
06:10.680 --> 06:11.750
Go ahead and sit down.

100
06:11.750 --> 06:12.480
I-I won't.

101
06:12.480 --> 06:13.410
I can't sit here.

102
06:14.070 --> 06:14.870
Go ahead and sit down.

103
06:14.870 --> 06:15.830
I can't...

104
06:25.360 --> 06:27.000
So you do want that seat after all.

105
06:27.000 --> 06:28.560
No, no, no!

106
06:28.560 --> 06:29.160
I...

107
06:29.160 --> 06:29.830
Please,

108
06:29.830 --> 06:30.560
take your seat.

109
06:30.560 --> 06:31.960
I'm not taking that seat.

110
06:33.920 --> 06:34.830
I r-really didn't

111
06:34.830 --> 06:36.190
m-mean to earlier.

112
06:36.870 --> 06:37.930
I was just so happy.

113
06:39.920 --> 06:41.390
Did you really mean

114
06:41.830 --> 06:43.090
what you said earlier?

115
06:43.190 --> 06:44.190
Absolutely.

116
06:44.190 --> 06:45.000
I meant

117
06:45.000 --> 06:45.870
every word.

118
06:45.950 --> 06:46.800
J-Just say the word.

119
06:46.800 --> 06:48.130
What do you need me to do?

120
06:51.240 --> 06:52.430
I want to put you

121
06:53.430 --> 06:54.630
in the hot seat.

122
06:56.390 --> 06:57.790
Why put me in the hot seat?

123
06:58.630 --> 06:59.390
Am I supposed to be Weslie, the Pleasant Goat

124
06:59.390 --> 07:00.720
while you play Wolffy?

125
07:01.070 --> 07:02.070
It's not that bad.

126
07:04.040 --> 07:05.360
I'll be Weslie, the Pleasant Goat,

127
07:05.360 --> 07:07.360
and you'll be Slowy, the Mayor Goat.

128
07:08.000 --> 07:09.160
Wait, what does that have to do with anything?

129
07:09.160 --> 07:10.720
You've lost me.

130
07:12.190 --> 07:13.000
Can you explain

131
07:13.000 --> 07:13.800
what you mean?

132
07:15.120 --> 07:16.270
Although I've been

133
07:16.270 --> 07:19.510
in talks with the company taking over Xiaoximen Hospital,

134
07:19.510 --> 07:20.390
I can't expect

135
07:20.390 --> 07:21.870
everything to go my way.

136
07:21.920 --> 07:22.720
That's true.

137
07:24.160 --> 07:25.820
There are bound to be changes,

138
07:26.920 --> 07:29.120
especially when it comes to personnel.

139
07:30.310 --> 07:31.950
So, what are you saying? Am I the one

140
07:31.950 --> 07:33.810
who's going to take the fall here?

141
07:38.000 --> 07:38.830
Hello,

142
07:39.390 --> 07:40.190
President.

143
07:40.950 --> 07:41.950
I'm back.

144
07:43.600 --> 07:45.330
I know my sudden disappearance

145
07:45.920 --> 07:47.190
caused a lot of trouble and frustration

146
07:47.190 --> 07:48.950
for the hospital

147
07:49.040 --> 07:50.100
and everyone here.

148
07:50.159 --> 07:51.090
I'm truly sorry.

149
07:51.270 --> 07:54.190
I sincerely apologize to you

150
07:55.430 --> 07:56.490
and the whole team.

151
07:57.800 --> 07:59.430
I just wanted to say

152
08:00.950 --> 08:01.870
I'm sorry.

153
08:04.480 --> 08:06.000
I also brought back

154
08:08.680 --> 08:09.480
a few local specialties

155
08:09.480 --> 08:11.540
from the Greater Khingan Mountains.

156
08:14.160 --> 08:15.800
They're for you and everyone else.

157
08:15.800 --> 08:17.630
Let me know when you're free,

158
08:18.630 --> 08:20.800
and I'll bring them over.

159
08:23.830 --> 08:24.630
Thank you.

160
09:31.770 --> 09:35.670
[Tomb of Loving Father Liu Chunsheng and Mother Li Zhongling]

161
10:00.840 --> 10:02.170
What are you doing here?

162
10:02.270 --> 10:03.080
Sir,

163
10:03.200 --> 10:05.150
could I borrow your bucket and broom

164
10:05.150 --> 10:06.360
for a moment?

165
10:53.750 --> 10:54.440
Um,

166
10:55.270 --> 10:56.800
are you Li Zhongling's son?

167
10:58.840 --> 10:59.870
You know my mom?

168
11:00.320 --> 11:01.670
I don't know your mom.

169
11:01.960 --> 11:04.600
I just know she came here twice a year,

170
11:04.790 --> 11:07.320
once in the twelfth lunar month and once around Qingming.

171
11:07.320 --> 11:09.480
She always stayed here until quite late.

172
11:09.480 --> 11:11.440
Most people don't spend

173
11:11.790 --> 11:12.960
that long here.

174
11:14.960 --> 11:17.150
I didn't even know her name until this year,

175
11:17.150 --> 11:19.030
when they added another name

176
11:19.030 --> 11:20.550
to this gravestone.

177
11:25.390 --> 11:26.030
Sir,

178
11:26.360 --> 11:28.360
how long have you been working here?

179
11:28.870 --> 11:31.000
About 15 or 16 years, maybe 17.

180
11:32.030 --> 11:32.960
I've lost count.

181
11:34.320 --> 11:35.390
Then you've probably known more dead people

182
11:35.390 --> 11:36.990
than I've known living ones.

183
11:37.440 --> 11:39.750
Watch your mouth, kid!

184
11:40.200 --> 11:41.510
I shouldn't have lent you that bucket.

185
11:41.510 --> 11:43.110
And now you're insulting me!

186
11:44.360 --> 11:46.220
Are there many people like my mom?

187
11:46.840 --> 11:47.770
A few years back,

188
11:48.080 --> 11:50.910
there was someone who cried even more than your mom did.

189
11:50.910 --> 11:52.080
Plenty of people have come and gone

190
11:52.080 --> 11:56.920
[Forever Remembered]

191
11:52.270 --> 11:53.390
over the years,

192
11:54.200 --> 11:55.550
but not many

193
11:56.960 --> 11:57.960
are like your mom.

194
12:03.790 --> 12:05.320
Then I'll be just like my mom.

195
12:05.320 --> 12:07.510
I'll come once in the twelfth lunar month

196
12:07.510 --> 12:09.390
and once around Qingming every year.

197
12:09.390 --> 12:11.120
Why are you telling me all this?

198
12:11.480 --> 12:13.140
What does it have to do with me?

199
12:35.600 --> 12:36.960
Sir, I have to go.

200
12:37.080 --> 12:39.320
I wish you a long and healthy life.

201
12:39.670 --> 12:41.000
And if you ever get sick,

202
12:41.000 --> 12:41.910
don't forget to come see me.

203
12:41.910 --> 12:43.150
Are you crazy?

204
12:43.600 --> 12:45.530
Who are you? Why would I come to you?

205
12:46.320 --> 12:47.360
I'm a doctor

206
12:48.360 --> 12:49.690
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

207
12:50.120 --> 12:51.440
My mom is Li Zhongling,

208
12:51.790 --> 12:53.200
my dad is Liu Chunsheng,

209
12:53.790 --> 12:56.120
and my younger brother is Liu Zhengguang.

210
12:56.510 --> 12:57.970
My name is Liu Zhengliang.

211
12:58.360 --> 12:59.510
I have a family.

212
13:02.080 --> 13:03.720
Zhou Zheng has made peace with it,

213
13:03.720 --> 13:04.630
and so have I.

214
13:05.840 --> 13:06.750
Some things,

215
13:06.870 --> 13:08.630
no matter how hard you fight them your whole life,

216
13:08.630 --> 13:09.670
may never go away.

217
13:10.870 --> 13:12.800
Maybe it's better to free yourself

218
13:13.030 --> 13:14.360
and let those things be.

219
13:14.720 --> 13:15.920
Keep living your life

220
13:16.230 --> 13:17.290
as you always have.

221
13:18.240 --> 13:19.570
Maybe the snow in my life

222
13:19.600 --> 13:20.750
will fall forever.

223
13:21.440 --> 13:23.320
But that doesn't mean I have to wait for it to stop

224
13:23.320 --> 13:24.580
before I step outside.

225
13:31.190 --> 13:34.030
[Fucheng City Taxi]

226
13:34.740 --> 13:38.580
[Fucheng Transport Company]

227
13:47.080 --> 13:47.870
You're here?

228
13:50.030 --> 13:50.840
Well,

229
13:51.270 --> 13:53.000
I wanted to show you something.

230
13:53.200 --> 13:54.000
What is it?

231
13:55.790 --> 13:56.670
Sit down. I'll show you.

232
13:56.670 --> 13:57.360
Here.

233
14:09.870 --> 14:11.080
Come on, take a look.

234
14:13.200 --> 14:14.630
Did they go on a trip?

235
14:15.200 --> 14:16.840
Pink took his mom on a trip.

236
14:16.840 --> 14:18.440
He just sent me these photos.

237
14:19.510 --> 14:20.570
That's wonderful.

238
14:21.750 --> 14:22.630
He also told me

239
14:22.630 --> 14:24.960
he'd told his mom all about his condition.

240
14:25.120 --> 14:26.250
Guess what she said?

241
14:27.440 --> 14:28.320
What?

242
14:28.840 --> 14:30.630
She said she'd known all along.

243
14:40.480 --> 14:41.750
Look how happy they are.

244
14:41.750 --> 14:42.480
See?

245
14:45.120 --> 14:47.630
You'd never guess he was feeling unwell, would you?

246
14:47.630 --> 14:48.510
He also told me

247
14:48.510 --> 14:50.510
he's going to keep smiling like this

248
14:50.510 --> 14:52.170
until the very end of his life.

249
14:59.390 --> 15:00.920
You're going to make me cry.

250
15:07.750 --> 15:09.150
There's something else.

251
15:10.360 --> 15:11.840
No need to look for the freezer anymore.

252
15:11.840 --> 15:14.100
We're calling off the exposure therapy.

253
15:25.840 --> 15:27.080
I've got things to take care of at the hospital,

254
15:27.080 --> 15:28.080
so I'll head back.

255
15:30.840 --> 15:31.630
My phone.

256
15:34.320 --> 15:35.200
Mrs. Mi Si.

257
15:40.720 --> 15:41.650
What's going on?

258
15:46.440 --> 15:47.840
What did he do?

259
15:47.840 --> 15:49.360
Why are you so happy?

260
15:51.150 --> 15:51.870
I just...

261
15:52.840 --> 15:54.030
I can't even find the words,

262
15:54.030 --> 15:54.320
Mom.

263
15:54.320 --> 15:56.920
He said he doesn't need the treatment anymore.

264
15:57.630 --> 15:58.550
Really?

265
16:00.270 --> 16:01.720
Does that mean our family's life

266
16:01.720 --> 16:03.510
can finally go back to normal?

267
16:07.460 --> 16:13.290
[Sealed February 27, 2024] [Not Disinfected]

268
16:35.630 --> 16:36.480
Last time, they said the place might shut down.

269
16:36.480 --> 16:37.550
This time, who knows? They might just

270
16:37.550 --> 16:39.750
lay everyone off, pay out the severance,

271
16:39.750 --> 16:40.750
and call it quits.

272
16:41.630 --> 16:43.440
How much longer do we have?

273
16:52.240 --> 16:53.910
Is Chen Junnan back?

274
16:56.080 --> 16:57.410
He's been back for days.

275
16:58.080 --> 16:59.140
Didn't he tell you?

276
17:00.080 --> 17:00.870
No.

277
17:01.720 --> 17:02.670
I only found out

278
17:02.670 --> 17:03.930
because my dad told me.

279
17:04.349 --> 17:05.550
How did your dad know?

280
17:06.960 --> 17:07.440
I have no idea

281
17:07.440 --> 17:09.240
when those two got back in touch.

282
17:10.880 --> 17:12.880
Uncle Che really is something else.

283
17:13.790 --> 17:14.589
Huang,

284
17:15.880 --> 17:17.240
didn't you let Chen Junnan know?

285
17:17.240 --> 17:18.770
How come he hasn't shown up?

286
17:20.480 --> 17:21.240
Huang,

287
17:23.349 --> 17:24.410
what are you doing?

288
17:25.920 --> 17:26.980
What, are you cold?

289
17:27.109 --> 17:28.270
No, not cold.

290
17:28.270 --> 17:29.750
Then why are you shivering?

291
17:29.750 --> 17:30.440
I'm not.

292
17:30.750 --> 17:32.610
Huang, where's your padded vest?

293
17:33.440 --> 17:35.370
I'm actually feeling a little hot.

294
17:35.720 --> 17:36.680
Quite a fire you've got going there.

295
17:36.680 --> 17:37.610
It's not too bad.

296
17:50.270 --> 17:51.240
A month ago,

297
17:51.280 --> 17:55.060
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

298
17:51.750 --> 17:53.880
it was announced that Xiaoximen Hospital

299
17:53.880 --> 17:55.240
would be shut down.

300
17:57.240 --> 17:58.440
Today,

301
18:00.440 --> 18:01.680
I have some latest news

302
18:01.680 --> 18:02.750
to share with you.

303
18:03.960 --> 18:05.090
Xiaoximen Hospital

304
18:06.030 --> 18:07.680
has been taken over by Xikang Group,

305
18:07.680 --> 18:08.790
one of the leading

306
18:10.750 --> 18:12.480
private healthcare providers

307
18:12.480 --> 18:14.310
in our province.

308
18:14.400 --> 18:15.640
It will be renamed

309
18:16.070 --> 18:17.590
Xiaoximen Hospital,

310
18:17.590 --> 18:19.510
affiliated with Xikang Medical.

311
18:20.960 --> 18:23.830
With improvements in both facilities and services,

312
18:23.830 --> 18:25.070
patients will receive

313
18:25.070 --> 18:26.730
even better care than before.

314
18:30.600 --> 18:33.720
[Emergency]

315
18:34.200 --> 18:35.930
But before Xiaoximen Hospital

316
18:37.000 --> 18:38.750
can rise from the ashes,

317
18:39.790 --> 18:41.350
there's one more challenge

318
18:41.350 --> 18:43.110
we need to address.

319
18:43.170 --> 18:50.750
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

320
18:43.590 --> 18:44.550
Xikang Group

321
18:44.720 --> 18:46.790
has selected

322
18:47.000 --> 18:48.790
100 outstanding employees

323
18:49.160 --> 18:50.590
from its other hospitals

324
18:51.000 --> 18:52.310
to join Xiaoximen Hospital.

325
18:52.310 --> 18:53.550
As a result,

326
18:57.110 --> 18:58.830
there will be

327
18:58.880 --> 19:01.640
fewer positions available

328
19:02.070 --> 19:04.070
for the existing Xiaoximen staff.

329
19:15.830 --> 19:16.830
I know

330
19:18.350 --> 19:19.960
some of you

331
19:19.960 --> 19:21.160
have already

332
19:21.040 --> 19:24.680
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

333
19:21.160 --> 19:22.020
found new jobs,

334
19:22.640 --> 19:23.680
while others

335
19:24.110 --> 19:26.240
have negotiated severance packages.

336
19:28.000 --> 19:30.030
The reopening of Xiaoximen Hospital

337
19:30.030 --> 19:33.680
won't affect those plans.

338
19:34.640 --> 19:36.030
Over the next day or two,

339
19:36.960 --> 19:38.290
the hospital president

340
19:38.440 --> 19:41.240
will begin holding one-on-one meetings with you.

341
19:41.480 --> 19:43.270
Anyone who wants to stay

342
19:43.830 --> 19:45.640
can fill out an application form.

343
19:45.640 --> 19:47.480
The new management team

344
19:47.480 --> 19:49.720
will then select from among those who wish to stay.

345
19:49.720 --> 19:50.880
But the reality is,

346
19:51.200 --> 19:52.720
many of you

347
19:52.720 --> 19:55.160
may not make the cut.

348
19:55.550 --> 19:56.350
S-Sorry to interrupt,

349
19:56.350 --> 19:57.350
President,

350
19:57.350 --> 19:58.880
but may I say something?

351
19:59.000 --> 20:01.000
Based on what you've just said,

352
20:01.000 --> 20:03.310
how many positions will be available?

353
20:01.560 --> 20:07.180
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

354
20:03.310 --> 20:05.000
President Long, now that we're becoming a private hospital,

355
20:05.000 --> 20:07.000
will there be any changes to our salaries?

356
20:07.000 --> 20:09.930
We don't want to end up doing more work for less money.

357
20:10.070 --> 20:10.440
President,

358
20:10.440 --> 20:11.720
what criteria will be used

359
20:11.720 --> 20:13.720
to select the people who get to stay?

360
20:14.830 --> 20:15.640
One more thing.

361
20:15.640 --> 20:16.640
This really

362
20:16.640 --> 20:17.640
is the last thing.

363
20:18.510 --> 20:20.480
For various reasons,

364
20:18.640 --> 20:22.040
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

365
20:21.640 --> 20:22.880
I'll be serving

366
20:22.880 --> 20:24.270
as a management consultant

367
20:24.270 --> 20:25.590
at Xiaoximen Hospital,

368
20:25.590 --> 20:27.450
affiliated with Xikang Medical.

369
20:28.720 --> 20:30.070
And when I said

370
20:30.070 --> 20:32.790
there would be one-on-one meetings with the hospital president,

371
20:32.790 --> 20:34.790
I meant the new hospital president.

372
20:34.960 --> 20:36.020
The new president?

373
20:36.070 --> 20:37.470
Who is the new president?

374
20:37.480 --> 20:39.740
The new president showed up pretty fast.

375
20:40.110 --> 20:41.110
Now,

376
20:41.920 --> 20:44.120
Now, let's give a warm round of applause

377
20:45.510 --> 20:47.000
to Comrade Huang Dongsheng,

378
20:45.620 --> 20:48.990
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

379
20:47.830 --> 20:49.070
our acting president

380
20:49.310 --> 20:50.400
for the preparatory period.

381
20:50.400 --> 20:52.070
Let's hear a few words from him.

382
20:52.070 --> 20:52.880
Who?

383
20:53.160 --> 20:54.620
-It's Huang? -It's Huang?

384
21:02.440 --> 21:04.100
As long as I get paid, I'm good.

385
21:20.480 --> 21:21.550
Distinguished

386
21:22.270 --> 21:23.670
President Long Dongdong

387
21:25.070 --> 21:27.440
and esteemed colleagues.

388
21:31.550 --> 21:33.590
I've been entrusted with this role at a critical time,

389
21:33.590 --> 21:35.270
and I must say, um,

390
21:36.350 --> 21:37.790
it's a

391
21:40.240 --> 21:42.570
heavy burden to bear. A very heavy burden.

392
21:44.640 --> 21:47.790
But one thing

393
21:47.790 --> 21:50.200
I can promise is

394
21:50.790 --> 21:53.270
that I won't

395
21:53.750 --> 21:55.400
let President Long down.

396
21:55.400 --> 21:57.660
I won't betray the trust he's placed in me

397
21:58.000 --> 21:58.930
or the... the...

398
21:59.400 --> 22:01.000
his heartfelt repentance.

399
22:01.640 --> 22:02.440
I mean,

400
22:02.640 --> 22:04.110
his guidance.

401
22:04.200 --> 22:05.960
Yes, his guidance.

402
22:07.350 --> 22:09.880
I will live up to his expectations

403
22:12.720 --> 22:15.380
and forge ahead, no matter how heavy the burden.

404
22:15.480 --> 22:17.160
Reform

405
22:17.160 --> 22:18.440
is inevitable.

406
22:18.920 --> 22:19.920
It has to happen.

407
22:20.070 --> 22:21.160
And I believe that,

408
22:21.160 --> 22:22.350
with all of us

409
22:22.350 --> 22:23.640
working together,

410
22:24.350 --> 22:26.720
we can

411
22:27.000 --> 22:30.310
breathe new life into Xiaoximen Hospital

412
22:30.590 --> 22:33.680
and help it flourish once again.

413
22:53.060 --> 22:56.820
[Designated Hospital for Urban and Rural Residents' Medical Insurance in Fucheng City]

414
22:53.510 --> 22:54.880
Do you know what's going on?

415
22:54.880 --> 22:56.240
Why do they insist on having one-on-one meetings?

416
22:56.240 --> 22:57.200
No idea.

417
22:56.850 --> 23:01.830
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

418
22:57.240 --> 22:58.770
They called me, so here I am.

419
22:59.270 --> 23:01.550
How long has the person before us been in there?

420
23:01.550 --> 23:02.790
Quite a while now.

421
23:03.350 --> 23:04.610
Still hasn't come out?

422
23:04.680 --> 23:06.830
Nope. The door's still closed.

423
23:07.920 --> 23:08.720
Stop scrolling on your phone.

424
23:08.720 --> 23:10.440
You might not hear them call your name later.

425
23:10.440 --> 23:12.370
I'm just having a look, that's all.

426
23:15.960 --> 23:17.420
Hold on, Huang Dongsheng,

427
23:17.480 --> 23:18.830
what the hell are you talking about?

428
23:18.830 --> 23:20.290
Do you even hear yourself?

429
23:20.400 --> 23:21.920
Is that any way to talk?

430
23:22.790 --> 23:24.120
Who do you think you are?

431
23:24.310 --> 23:25.640
How am I even

432
23:25.920 --> 23:26.960
supposed to describe someone like you?

433
23:26.960 --> 23:28.070
This job's not easy, is it?

434
23:28.070 --> 23:29.590
-You can say that again. -You're just a nobody...

435
23:29.590 --> 23:30.640
pretending to be

436
23:30.640 --> 23:32.590
some big shot!

437
23:30.780 --> 23:40.330
[Healing pain with compassion, lighting up hope with dedication]

438
23:33.480 --> 23:33.960
Wait,

439
23:33.960 --> 23:36.360
when did you even join Xiaoximen Hospital?

440
23:36.440 --> 23:37.920
And when did I join?

441
23:37.920 --> 23:39.110
You think you can compare yourself to me?

442
23:39.110 --> 23:40.160
Stop acting like some big shot!

443
23:40.160 --> 23:41.360
Quit putting on airs!

444
23:42.160 --> 23:44.400
Let's talk this out calmly.

445
23:44.790 --> 23:45.790
I'm the hospital president.

446
23:45.790 --> 23:46.440
What?

447
23:46.960 --> 23:47.960
What did you say? I didn't quite catch that.

448
23:47.960 --> 23:49.030
Say it again.

449
23:49.350 --> 23:50.790
You're the President?

450
23:51.440 --> 23:52.270
Just look at the nonsense

451
23:52.270 --> 23:53.550
you spouted onstage!

452
23:54.030 --> 23:55.350
"Th-th-th...

453
23:55.440 --> 23:56.590
Esteemed...

454
23:56.960 --> 23:59.090
esteemed colleagues at the hospital,

455
23:59.200 --> 24:00.070
under

456
24:00.070 --> 24:01.920
President Long's leadership and... repentance..."

457
24:01.920 --> 24:03.240
You even said "repentance"!

458
24:03.240 --> 24:04.640
Do you even know what that word means?

459
24:04.640 --> 24:05.970
Have you ever repented?

460
24:06.640 --> 24:07.550
Look,

461
24:07.830 --> 24:09.160
the President is right here,

462
24:08.710 --> 24:17.170
[Healing pain with compassion, lighting up hope with dedication]

463
24:09.160 --> 24:10.290
sitting right here!

464
24:11.880 --> 24:12.810
President Long,

465
24:12.960 --> 24:14.440
you have to stand up for justice!

466
24:14.440 --> 24:15.640
You can't let this man

467
24:15.750 --> 24:16.960
run wild!

468
24:19.480 --> 24:20.750
If he's forcing you to do this,

469
24:20.750 --> 24:22.350
just blink twice!

470
24:23.070 --> 24:24.790
I'm no longer the President.

471
24:25.720 --> 24:26.920
Huang is in charge now.

472
24:26.920 --> 24:28.450
I'm just here to assist him.

473
24:28.550 --> 24:29.590
A-Assist him?

474
24:31.480 --> 24:32.410
President Long?

475
24:38.720 --> 24:40.790
How many complaints have you gotten this month?

476
24:40.630 --> 24:48.170
[Stay True to Our Original Aspiration and Keep Our Mission in Mind]

477
24:41.480 --> 24:42.270
Two.

478
24:42.830 --> 24:44.830
That's a lot better than last month.

479
24:45.550 --> 24:46.950
And you're proud of that?

480
24:47.200 --> 24:48.790
Have you no shame?

481
24:50.030 --> 24:50.400
Boss,

482
24:50.400 --> 24:51.270
if you have something to say, just say it.

483
24:51.270 --> 24:52.640
There's no need to insult me.

484
24:52.640 --> 24:53.350
Besides, this wasn't

485
24:53.350 --> 24:54.750
even my fault.

486
24:54.960 --> 24:56.000
He put down the wrong address,

487
24:56.000 --> 24:57.480
so I had to deliver the package again.

488
24:57.480 --> 24:59.030
I won't even complain about the extra trip.

489
24:59.030 --> 25:00.160
I was just a little late,

490
25:00.160 --> 25:00.920
and he started cursing me out.

491
25:00.920 --> 25:01.680
So just because he cursed at you,

492
25:01.680 --> 25:03.200
that gives you the right to curse him back?

493
25:03.200 --> 25:04.920
Why shouldn't I?

494
25:06.200 --> 25:07.830
Because you're the one providing the service,

495
25:07.830 --> 25:09.160
and he's the customer!

496
25:09.680 --> 25:10.960
So what if he cursed at you?

497
25:10.960 --> 25:12.360
What makes you so special

498
25:12.400 --> 25:13.960
that you can't even take a little abuse?

499
25:13.960 --> 25:14.750
I'm just doing a service job,

500
25:14.750 --> 25:16.350
but I still earn my living

501
25:16.350 --> 25:17.750
through hard work.

502
25:17.960 --> 25:19.070
Why should I put up with being mistreated?

503
25:19.070 --> 25:20.400
I'm no less than him.

504
25:21.200 --> 25:22.680
He has no right to insult me,

505
25:22.680 --> 25:23.740
and neither do you.

506
25:24.750 --> 25:26.550
You think I enjoy chewing you out?

507
25:26.550 --> 25:27.240
If I hadn't

508
25:27.240 --> 25:28.310
brought a troublemaker

509
25:28.310 --> 25:29.160
like you on board,

510
25:29.160 --> 25:29.640
would I be dealing

511
25:29.640 --> 25:31.440
with all these problems?

512
25:31.750 --> 25:33.030
If you don't want to work, then get lost!

513
25:33.030 --> 25:34.640
Go home and live like a king!

514
25:35.830 --> 25:36.830
Fine, I'm done!

515
25:36.880 --> 25:37.880
What are you gonna do about it?

516
25:37.880 --> 25:38.960
Hit me?

517
25:39.310 --> 25:40.440
You're practically halfway

518
25:40.440 --> 25:41.070
to the grave at your age.

519
25:41.070 --> 25:42.930
You think you can still take me on?

520
25:43.110 --> 25:43.840
Medicine...

521
25:45.790 --> 25:46.590
medicine.

522
25:46.750 --> 25:48.000
W-What did you say?

523
25:48.550 --> 25:49.720
In the drawer.

524
25:51.160 --> 25:51.400
Quick-acting...

525
25:51.400 --> 25:52.130
Medicine...

526
25:52.510 --> 25:53.770
Q-Q-Quick-acting...

527
25:57.400 --> 25:57.960
Boss!

528
25:57.960 --> 25:59.400
Boss! Are you okay? Boss!

529
25:59.400 --> 26:00.070
Boss!

530
26:00.160 --> 26:00.960
Boss!

531
26:01.960 --> 26:03.550
Boss! Boss!

532
26:05.400 --> 26:06.480
I... Oh, right. Right.

533
26:06.480 --> 26:07.720
I'm telling you,

534
26:07.720 --> 26:09.070
you've got it all backwards!

535
26:09.070 --> 26:09.510
Hello?

536
26:09.510 --> 26:10.880
You're abusing your power

537
26:10.880 --> 26:12.810
and mistreating your colleagues!

538
26:13.310 --> 26:14.030
Let me find somewhere quiet

539
26:14.030 --> 26:15.000
to talk to you.

540
26:15.160 --> 26:16.090
I'm telling you.

541
26:16.680 --> 26:18.200
Huang Dongsheng?

542
26:17.740 --> 26:21.120
[Healing pain with compassion, lighting up hope with dedication]

543
26:18.240 --> 26:19.770
More like Huang the Weasel!

544
26:20.310 --> 26:21.310
When you call his name,

545
26:21.310 --> 26:22.350
does he respond?

546
26:22.590 --> 26:23.400
No.

547
26:25.240 --> 26:26.440
What about the ambulance? Have you called one?

548
26:26.440 --> 26:27.110
Yes,

549
26:27.110 --> 26:29.370
b-but it'll be another ten minutes or so.

550
26:29.440 --> 26:30.110
I-I think I made him so angry

551
26:30.110 --> 26:31.200
that he passed out.

552
26:31.200 --> 26:32.200
H-He can't

553
26:32.240 --> 26:33.070
be dead, can he?

554
26:33.070 --> 26:34.350
All right, Liu Zhengguang,

555
26:34.350 --> 26:35.000
calm down.

556
26:35.000 --> 26:36.200
He's going to be fine.

557
26:36.310 --> 26:37.240
Listen to me.

558
26:37.400 --> 26:38.640
I need you to check his carotid pulse

559
26:38.640 --> 26:40.000
with your fingers,

560
26:40.030 --> 26:42.070
about a centimeter beside his Adam's apple.

561
26:42.070 --> 26:43.200
Can you feel a pulse?

562
26:44.350 --> 26:44.960
No.

563
26:44.960 --> 26:46.270
I... I can't feel anything.

564
26:46.270 --> 26:47.160
T-There's no pulse.

565
26:47.160 --> 26:48.240
Why don't we just leave him alone

566
26:48.240 --> 26:49.400
and wait

567
26:49.400 --> 26:50.460
for the ambulance?

568
26:51.270 --> 26:52.960
W-What do I do?

569
26:55.310 --> 26:56.590
He needs CPR.

570
26:58.070 --> 26:59.130
Do exactly as I say.

571
26:59.270 --> 27:00.880
Lay him flat on the ground,

572
27:00.880 --> 27:02.200
then kneel beside him.

573
27:03.480 --> 27:05.080
I'm kneeling. I'm kneeling.

574
27:05.160 --> 27:06.000
What now?

575
27:06.510 --> 27:07.920
Place the heel of one hand

576
27:08.000 --> 27:10.000
in the center of his chest,

577
27:10.240 --> 27:11.720
clasp your other hand over it,

578
27:11.720 --> 27:12.750
and keep your arms straight.

579
27:12.750 --> 27:14.550
Use your upper body weight to push down.

580
27:14.160 --> 27:16.500
[Dumb Liu]

581
27:14.550 --> 27:16.160
Compress his chest to a depth of five to six centimeters,

582
27:16.160 --> 27:17.070
at a rate of 100

583
27:17.070 --> 27:18.030
to 120 compressions per minute.

584
27:18.030 --> 27:19.000
Got that?

585
27:19.070 --> 27:19.920
Are you sure

586
27:20.000 --> 27:20.750
this will work?

587
27:20.750 --> 27:22.400
I'm sure. Trust me.

588
27:22.480 --> 27:23.590
Follow my rhythm.

589
27:24.030 --> 27:25.160
When I say "down,"

590
27:25.240 --> 27:26.030
you push.

591
27:26.590 --> 27:27.400
Start now.

592
27:27.640 --> 27:33.270
Down, down, down.

593
27:33.400 --> 27:39.480
Down, down, down.

594
27:39.590 --> 27:40.720
Keep that rhythm.

595
27:40.920 --> 27:42.000
And remember,

596
27:42.110 --> 27:44.440
keep your arms straight. Don't bend them.

597
27:52.590 --> 27:53.400
How is he?

598
27:53.680 --> 27:54.590
Any change?

599
27:55.310 --> 27:56.110
No,

600
27:56.240 --> 27:57.440
he's still not breathing.

601
27:57.440 --> 27:58.000
He is...

602
27:58.070 --> 27:59.550
he is turning purple.

603
28:01.160 --> 28:02.680
After every 30 compressions,

604
28:02.680 --> 28:03.960
give him two rescue breaths.

605
28:03.960 --> 28:05.750
Tilt his head back, lift his chin,

606
28:05.750 --> 28:06.590
pinch his nose shut,

607
28:06.590 --> 28:08.550
and breathe into his mouth. Hurry!

608
28:09.400 --> 28:10.400
I... I did it.

609
28:10.590 --> 28:11.400
Keep going.

610
28:11.510 --> 28:12.840
Count 30 compressions.

611
28:16.270 --> 28:17.550
28, 29,

612
28:17.680 --> 28:18.720
30. Stop.

613
28:18.880 --> 28:20.340
Give him two more breaths.

614
28:21.830 --> 28:22.640
I did it.

615
28:26.680 --> 28:27.960
H-He's breathing!

616
28:27.960 --> 28:28.890
He's breathing!

617
28:29.680 --> 28:30.880
He couldn't catch his breath just now.

618
28:30.880 --> 28:31.480
It was terrifying to watch.

619
28:31.480 --> 28:32.200
Oh my God!

620
28:35.270 --> 28:35.880
All right,

621
28:36.550 --> 28:38.110
turn his head to the side

622
28:38.160 --> 28:39.960
and just wait for the ambulance.

623
28:45.790 --> 28:47.790
My heart was in my throat.

624
28:47.920 --> 28:50.510
I really thought something terrible was going to happen.

625
28:50.510 --> 28:51.830
I can't believe someone could actually

626
28:51.830 --> 28:53.000
talk a person through CPR over the phone.

627
28:53.000 --> 28:53.930
That's amazing!

628
28:55.640 --> 28:56.440
Zhengguang,

629
28:57.680 --> 28:58.480
well done!

630
29:00.440 --> 29:01.900
That's my little brother!

631
29:03.310 --> 29:05.240
You did a great job guiding me, too.

632
29:07.510 --> 29:08.770
That's my big brother!

633
29:20.880 --> 29:21.680
Huang,

634
29:22.240 --> 29:24.300
what's that expression on your face?

635
29:26.550 --> 29:27.110
Well, um...

636
29:27.110 --> 29:28.550
weren't you planning

637
29:28.550 --> 29:29.550
to go for your PhD?

638
29:30.350 --> 29:31.160
I, um,

639
29:31.200 --> 29:32.030
I only submitted my application

640
29:32.030 --> 29:33.240
in November.

641
29:33.790 --> 29:34.510
Besides,

642
29:34.510 --> 29:35.920
what if I don't get in?

643
29:35.920 --> 29:38.320
I'd still have to keep working, wouldn't I?

644
29:39.240 --> 29:40.030
Right,

645
29:40.640 --> 29:41.550
but...

646
29:41.550 --> 29:42.830
here's the thing...

647
29:42.830 --> 29:43.750
h-here's the thing...

648
29:43.750 --> 29:46.480
There are more people than positions available.

649
29:47.350 --> 29:47.830
If I

650
29:47.830 --> 29:49.590
offer you the position

651
29:50.030 --> 29:51.400
and you get into the PhD program

652
29:51.400 --> 29:52.160
and don't come back afterward,

653
29:52.160 --> 29:53.030
then I'll...

654
29:53.510 --> 29:54.240
I...

655
29:54.510 --> 29:55.310
No,

656
29:55.720 --> 29:57.680
I'll come back after I finish my PhD.

657
29:57.680 --> 29:58.790
No, no, no.

658
29:58.790 --> 29:59.510
I mean,

659
29:59.510 --> 30:00.000
um,

660
30:00.000 --> 30:02.000
once you get into the PhD program, your position will be vacant,

661
30:02.000 --> 30:02.680
and then

662
30:02.680 --> 30:04.680
people will come after me, you know?

663
30:04.720 --> 30:06.180
What are you trying to say?

664
30:07.440 --> 30:08.160
I... I just mean

665
30:08.160 --> 30:09.480
that if the position becomes vacant,

666
30:09.480 --> 30:10.920
it'll put me in a really difficult spot.

667
30:10.920 --> 30:11.920
-What are you trying to say, then? -It's really hard.

668
30:11.920 --> 30:13.240
It's hard, you know?

669
30:13.240 --> 30:14.070
Very hard.

670
30:15.270 --> 30:16.480
Are you letting your position dictate how you think,

671
30:16.480 --> 30:17.240
Huang?

672
30:17.240 --> 30:17.830
Seriously,

673
30:17.830 --> 30:18.590
why have you changed so much

674
30:18.590 --> 30:19.440
the moment you became a leader?

675
30:19.440 --> 30:20.720
What kind of leader am I?

676
30:20.720 --> 30:22.520
Tell me, what kind of leader am I?

677
30:22.920 --> 30:23.750
I'm just taking the fall

678
30:23.750 --> 30:24.880
for President Long!

679
30:25.200 --> 30:26.270
Once I've cleaned up

680
30:26.270 --> 30:27.480
this whole mess,

681
30:27.480 --> 30:28.880
X-Xikang Medical

682
30:28.880 --> 30:29.880
will send over

683
30:29.880 --> 30:31.400
a new president.

684
30:31.880 --> 30:32.830
What do you think

685
30:32.830 --> 30:34.630
I'll get out of being President?

686
30:36.830 --> 30:39.030
T-Then why did you agree to take the job?

687
30:40.000 --> 30:41.480
I just wanted to see

688
30:41.480 --> 30:42.400
what it felt like to be a president.

689
30:42.400 --> 30:43.160
I'd never been one before.

690
30:43.160 --> 30:44.490
And how does it feel now?

691
30:45.960 --> 30:46.830
It's intense.

692
30:52.920 --> 30:55.070
T-This is no job for a human being.

693
30:55.480 --> 30:56.270
Huang,

694
30:57.000 --> 30:57.790
this was your decision.

695
30:57.790 --> 30:59.990
You have to take responsibility for it.

696
31:00.400 --> 31:01.160
Anyway,

697
31:02.070 --> 31:04.330
we've been colleagues for so many years.

698
31:04.510 --> 31:06.070
You know me better than anyone, don't you?

699
31:06.070 --> 31:06.720
I

700
31:06.830 --> 31:08.030
have never

701
31:08.030 --> 31:09.690
let Xiaoximen Hospital down.

702
31:10.350 --> 31:10.880
Then Xiaoximen Hospital

703
31:10.880 --> 31:12.610
shouldn't let me down, either.

704
31:13.960 --> 31:15.480
And neither should you.

705
31:22.440 --> 31:23.310
Look,

706
31:23.310 --> 31:24.720
um,

707
31:24.880 --> 31:25.880
just let me...

708
31:26.350 --> 31:27.070
let me think it over.

709
31:27.070 --> 31:27.830
T-There are

710
31:28.070 --> 31:29.110
so many people watching.

711
31:29.110 --> 31:29.910
Can you please

712
31:30.160 --> 31:32.110
show a little support?

713
31:36.590 --> 31:37.400
Please?

714
31:47.160 --> 31:48.000
Just...

715
31:49.880 --> 31:51.340
just give me a chance to...

716
31:53.480 --> 31:54.270
Mingming.

717
31:54.510 --> 31:55.070
Hey, don't, don't.

718
31:55.070 --> 31:56.400
Don't cry. Don't cry...

719
32:03.590 --> 32:04.640
Don't cry...

720
32:17.830 --> 32:18.440
This...

721
32:18.590 --> 32:20.880
This is just downright heartless.

722
32:23.350 --> 32:23.790
Mom, Dad,

723
32:23.790 --> 32:26.200
there's something I want to talk over with you.

724
32:26.200 --> 32:27.030
Go ahead.

725
32:27.790 --> 32:30.160
Whatever it is, your dad and I will support you.

726
32:30.160 --> 32:32.090
I don't want to be a doctor anymore.

727
32:36.310 --> 32:37.910
You don't want to be a doctor?

728
32:38.000 --> 32:39.510
You can't just quit being a doctor

729
32:39.510 --> 32:41.030
after all these years.

730
32:42.200 --> 32:42.880
I think

731
32:42.880 --> 32:44.830
going into medicine was a mistake.

732
32:46.070 --> 32:47.000
I

733
32:47.790 --> 32:49.830
need to correct that mistake.

734
32:51.400 --> 32:52.160
W-Wait,

735
32:52.160 --> 32:52.830
Chen.

736
32:53.440 --> 32:54.640
Don't get worked up.

737
32:54.680 --> 32:55.880
You need to give him some time

738
32:55.880 --> 32:57.410
to process this, don't you?

739
32:57.920 --> 32:59.200
Look how upset you've made your dad.

740
32:59.200 --> 32:59.960
Why do you

741
33:00.030 --> 33:01.890
keep changing your mind on a whim?

742
33:03.030 --> 33:03.830
Chen Junnan,

743
33:06.000 --> 33:06.920
I support you.

744
33:07.480 --> 33:08.270
What?

745
33:09.310 --> 33:10.110
Chen,

746
33:10.720 --> 33:12.050
have you lost your mind?

747
33:12.200 --> 33:13.070
You know, we used to think

748
33:13.070 --> 33:15.310
being a doctor was a secure, lifelong career.

749
33:15.310 --> 33:16.510
The older you got, the more valuable you became.

750
33:16.510 --> 33:17.570
What a load of crap.

751
33:18.350 --> 33:19.960
After doing this for so many years, I finally realized

752
33:19.960 --> 33:23.550
that you're carrying the weight of other people's lives in your hands.

753
33:23.550 --> 33:24.480
You never wanted

754
33:25.030 --> 33:27.090
to study medicine in the first place.

755
33:27.880 --> 33:29.680
Making you do it was a mistake.

756
33:30.590 --> 33:32.590
It wasn't your mistake. It was mine.

757
33:34.400 --> 33:35.830
Back then,

758
33:36.110 --> 33:37.720
I thought if you became a doctor,

759
33:37.720 --> 33:38.720
I could pull some strings

760
33:38.720 --> 33:40.720
and get you a job when you graduated.

761
33:42.030 --> 33:43.480
I never stopped to think about you—

762
33:43.480 --> 33:44.550
whether you liked it

763
33:44.550 --> 33:46.280
or whether it was right for you.

764
33:49.920 --> 33:50.720
Junnan,

765
33:52.920 --> 33:54.980
while you were away in the mountains,

766
33:56.350 --> 33:57.950
I had a lot of time to reflect.

767
34:03.480 --> 34:04.680
And I realized...

768
34:06.680 --> 34:08.280
I realized I'd held you back.

769
34:08.960 --> 34:11.219
More than ten years of your life are gone.

770
34:11.440 --> 34:12.230
The...

771
34:12.550 --> 34:13.510
The most

772
34:13.510 --> 34:14.670
precious years of your life...

773
34:14.670 --> 34:16.150
I wasted them.

774
34:16.280 --> 34:18.070
Dad, no... You didn't waste them.

775
34:18.070 --> 34:18.550
You didn't.

776
34:18.550 --> 34:20.510
Let me apologize to you again, okay?

777
34:20.510 --> 34:21.670
No, Dad.

778
34:24.030 --> 34:26.150
I just want to make a fresh start.

779
34:26.190 --> 34:26.920
All right.

780
34:27.920 --> 34:28.710
Junnan,

781
34:30.230 --> 34:32.360
let's toast with milk instead of wine.

782
34:32.590 --> 34:34.480
Here's a toast to your new journey!

783
34:34.480 --> 34:35.550
Wait, wait, wait!

784
34:36.150 --> 34:37.000
What is going on here?

785
34:37.000 --> 34:38.070
You two just went back and forth

786
34:38.070 --> 34:39.730
and made the decision for him?

787
34:40.070 --> 34:41.670
He studied medicine for all those years,

788
34:41.670 --> 34:42.960
and now he's just going to quit?

789
34:42.960 --> 34:44.630
If you're not going to be a doctor,

790
34:44.630 --> 34:45.960
what are you going to do?

791
34:47.360 --> 34:48.550
Anything.

792
34:48.960 --> 34:50.020
Exactly. Tell her!

793
34:50.670 --> 34:51.480
I could...

794
34:53.800 --> 34:55.190
I could raise cattle.

795
34:55.710 --> 34:56.590
Oh, get out of here!

796
34:56.590 --> 34:58.120
-What? -Raise cattle? You?

797
34:58.630 --> 34:59.480
You can't just go

798
34:59.480 --> 35:01.000
f-from one extreme to the other!

799
35:01.000 --> 35:01.800
Raise cattle?

800
35:01.800 --> 35:03.070
And cattle...

801
35:03.150 --> 35:06.680
do you even know how to raise them? Starting with calves and all?

802
35:16.280 --> 35:18.150
Someone from the Marine Research Institute called.

803
35:18.150 --> 35:20.150
They said Yaya has fully recovered.

804
35:20.190 --> 35:22.520
You can finally stop worrying now, right?

805
35:22.710 --> 35:23.550
Who's Yaya?

806
35:25.400 --> 35:26.400
Didn't you name

807
35:26.400 --> 35:27.800
that seal Yaya?

808
35:29.360 --> 35:30.560
Don't be ridiculous.

809
35:30.590 --> 35:32.450
Yaya is your childhood nickname.

810
35:32.630 --> 35:33.710
How could I give a seal

811
35:33.710 --> 35:35.170
your childhood nickname?

812
35:37.670 --> 35:39.600
I must've remembered wrong, then.

813
35:42.280 --> 35:43.070
Coming.

814
35:44.280 --> 35:45.150
Coming.

815
35:56.230 --> 35:57.320
I'm heading

816
35:57.320 --> 35:59.360
to Beijing in a few days to discuss a business deal.

817
35:59.360 --> 36:01.760
I'm planning to leave in the next day or two.

818
36:04.070 --> 36:05.190
So, you're giving up being a doctor

819
36:05.190 --> 36:06.720
to become a business owner?

820
36:08.510 --> 36:09.320
No,

821
36:09.480 --> 36:10.150
I just...

822
36:11.190 --> 36:13.450
I need to figure out something else to do.

823
36:22.000 --> 36:23.150
Is that why you came here?

824
36:23.150 --> 36:25.350
Just to tell me you're going to Beijing?

825
36:25.800 --> 36:27.150
You didn't have to.

826
36:28.000 --> 36:29.630
You went all the way to the Greater Khingan Mountains

827
36:29.630 --> 36:32.160
to see my ex-husband without even telling me.

828
36:35.920 --> 36:36.800
I'm sorry.

829
36:37.440 --> 36:38.960
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

830
36:38.960 --> 36:40.490
You don't owe me an apology.

831
36:40.920 --> 36:42.920
You're free to go wherever you want.

832
36:42.920 --> 36:45.150
We're just colleagues.

833
36:45.630 --> 36:47.360
It's not like we're that close.

834
36:59.190 --> 37:00.850
Has Uncle Che been to Beijing?

835
37:02.150 --> 37:03.800
No. Why?

836
37:03.960 --> 37:05.490
I'd like to take him with me.

837
37:07.440 --> 37:08.280
Why?

838
37:08.840 --> 37:09.760
Didn't he used to say

839
37:09.760 --> 37:11.190
he had a job in Beijing?

840
37:11.760 --> 37:12.840
Maybe taking him there

841
37:12.840 --> 37:13.960
would help

842
37:15.320 --> 37:16.450
with his condition.

843
37:18.510 --> 37:19.320
It won't work.

844
37:19.670 --> 37:21.470
I've suggested it to him before,

845
37:21.630 --> 37:23.030
but he flat-out refused.

846
37:23.510 --> 37:24.320
He...

847
37:24.670 --> 37:27.320
He said he'd been sent here by the organization on a mission,

848
37:27.320 --> 37:29.360
and that he couldn't return to Beijing until the time was right.

849
37:29.360 --> 37:31.560
We can't exactly force him to go, can we?

850
37:33.840 --> 37:36.500
I didn't know the whole story. Never mind, then.

851
37:37.190 --> 37:40.250
The tale of the golden millet dream on the road to Handan

852
37:40.760 --> 37:43.960
reminds us not to envy Lu Sheng's fleeting dream of glory.

853
37:49.590 --> 37:50.720
Commissioner Chen.

854
37:51.280 --> 37:53.140
Commissioner Chen, you're here!

855
37:54.550 --> 37:55.360
Does this mean

856
37:55.800 --> 37:56.960
the time has finally come

857
37:56.960 --> 37:58.440
for me to return to Beijing and give my report?

858
37:58.440 --> 38:00.440
Comrade Xiaobo told you, didn't he?

859
38:03.320 --> 38:05.920
The day I've been waiting for has finally come!

860
38:22.280 --> 38:23.230
What's going on?

861
38:23.760 --> 38:25.400
Why'd you call me out here in such a hurry?

862
38:25.400 --> 38:25.840
I have to get back to the hospital

863
38:25.840 --> 38:27.300
for some overtime in a bit.

864
38:29.920 --> 38:31.450
Do you remember this place?

865
38:33.550 --> 38:34.670
Of course I do.

866
38:35.280 --> 38:36.110
Didn't we used to come here

867
38:36.110 --> 38:38.240
and play all the time when we were kids?

868
38:40.840 --> 38:42.590
The last time we came here

869
38:43.590 --> 38:45.520
was before you left for Guangzhou.

870
38:49.400 --> 38:50.400
I wonder if that little shop over there

871
38:50.400 --> 38:51.360
is still open.

872
38:53.360 --> 38:54.230
It's gone.

873
39:03.920 --> 39:05.720
I'm planning to move to Beijing.

874
39:07.070 --> 39:08.000
What do you mean?

875
39:08.400 --> 39:10.600
You're not going to be a doctor anymore?

876
39:11.590 --> 39:12.550
Ever since I

877
39:12.550 --> 39:14.150
failed to save that patient,

878
39:14.360 --> 39:15.630
I've been terrified every time

879
39:15.630 --> 39:17.490
I have to attempt resuscitation.

880
39:18.150 --> 39:20.110
Even when I went to the Greater Khingan Mountains

881
39:20.110 --> 39:22.710
and saw those animals barely clinging to life,

882
39:23.000 --> 39:24.630
I was so scared

883
39:25.400 --> 39:26.360
I was shaking.

884
39:28.590 --> 39:30.360
But that's when I realized

885
39:32.070 --> 39:33.880
what scares me most

886
39:34.280 --> 39:35.940
is having someone else's life

887
39:36.110 --> 39:37.360
in my hands.

888
39:38.760 --> 39:40.220
You're different from me.

889
39:40.760 --> 39:41.440
You're always the first

890
39:41.440 --> 39:43.440
to rush in when a patient needs help,

891
39:44.070 --> 39:45.730
no matter how things turn out.

892
39:46.000 --> 39:47.840
Can you stop making me sound like some kind of hero?

893
39:47.840 --> 39:48.550
I'm not.

894
39:48.550 --> 39:50.280
I'm not as amazing as you think.

895
39:53.840 --> 39:55.710
I just can't face the moment

896
39:56.590 --> 39:57.760
when someone dies.

897
40:02.480 --> 40:03.940
We're the same in that way.

898
40:06.190 --> 40:07.880
I just chose to run away.

899
40:10.070 --> 40:12.070
If I run away, I don't have to face it.

900
40:12.550 --> 40:14.150
And if I don't have to face it,

901
40:15.550 --> 40:17.230
I don't have to feel

902
40:18.190 --> 40:19.650
that helplessness again.

903
40:22.920 --> 40:23.760
I understand.

904
40:25.480 --> 40:26.280
I really do.

905
40:33.510 --> 40:35.640
Have you really thought this through?

906
40:36.320 --> 40:38.450
Have you really thought this through?

907
40:41.440 --> 40:42.880
If you move to Guangzhou,

908
40:44.110 --> 40:44.880
we won't be able

909
40:44.880 --> 40:46.230
to hang out anymore.

910
40:47.000 --> 40:47.960
Besides,

911
40:48.510 --> 40:49.400
do you think

912
40:50.360 --> 40:53.110
they even have lollipops like ours over there?

913
40:55.030 --> 40:56.230
My mom wants me to go.

914
40:59.150 --> 41:00.800
If you really don't want to,

915
41:01.360 --> 41:03.490
just make a fuss about it with your mom.

916
41:04.190 --> 41:05.760
When my parents make me do something

917
41:05.760 --> 41:07.400
I really don't want to do,

918
41:07.800 --> 41:08.590
I throw a fit.

919
41:09.000 --> 41:09.800
Then they

920
41:09.800 --> 41:11.030
stop pushing me.

921
41:13.000 --> 41:15.110
Mom says my condition

922
41:15.480 --> 41:16.840
might get better if I move there.

923
41:16.840 --> 41:18.040
I want to give it a try.

924
41:18.710 --> 41:20.110
After all, when winter comes here,

925
41:20.110 --> 41:21.590
I can't even go outside.

926
41:24.320 --> 41:25.110
All right.

927
41:25.590 --> 41:27.280
Lollipops are on me today.

928
41:27.320 --> 41:28.030
Okay.

929
41:28.710 --> 41:29.920
I'll treat you next time.

930
41:29.920 --> 41:30.710
Deal.

931
41:41.960 --> 41:42.800
All right.

932
41:43.280 --> 41:43.800
As long as

933
41:43.800 --> 41:45.730
you've really thought it through.

934
41:48.550 --> 41:49.550
What are you

935
41:49.550 --> 41:51.010
planning to do in Beijing?

936
41:51.880 --> 41:53.150
I'm thinking

937
41:54.800 --> 41:57.550
of getting involved in a medical equipment project.

938
41:57.550 --> 41:59.360
I'll just be lending a hand behind the scenes.

939
41:59.360 --> 42:00.440
You could say

940
42:00.960 --> 42:03.490
I'll still be saving lives, just indirectly.

941
42:05.030 --> 42:05.840
Sounds good.

942
42:06.110 --> 42:08.170
Working behind the scenes suits you.

943
42:11.510 --> 42:12.640
Do you remember how,

944
42:13.030 --> 42:13.550
whenever someone

945
42:13.550 --> 42:15.000
picked on me as a kid,

946
42:15.320 --> 42:16.110
you'd come charging out

947
42:16.110 --> 42:17.400
of some random corner

948
42:17.400 --> 42:18.590
to stand up for me?

949
42:18.710 --> 42:19.590
Come on, let's not talk about that.

950
42:19.590 --> 42:21.120
Seriously! It was amazing!

951
42:28.440 --> 42:29.370
Liu Zhengliang,

952
42:30.920 --> 42:32.720
you don't look down on me, do you?

953
42:34.190 --> 42:36.120
When have I ever looked down on you?

954
42:37.760 --> 42:39.090
How does that saying go?

955
42:40.230 --> 42:41.960
No matter where life takes you,

956
42:42.320 --> 42:45.150
we'll always be brothers.

957
42:56.360 --> 42:58.290
When are we coming back here again?

958
43:00.880 --> 43:01.710
Anytime.
